# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 本地忽略名单 · 示例模板（Local ignore list · example template）
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# 用法：复制为 .skillignore 后生效
#   cp .skillignore.example .skillignore
#
# 说明：
#   - .skillignore 是你的**本地私有**配置，不会被上传到仓库
#     （已在 .gitignore 中，仓库里只有这份 .example 模板）
#   - 每行一个 skill 名，# 开头为注释
#   - 名单里的 skill 不会被 upload.sh 上传；若仓库中已存在会被移除
#
# Usage: copy this file to .skillignore first
#   cp .skillignore.example .skillignore
#
#   - .skillignore is your LOCAL private config; it is never uploaded
#     (listed in .gitignore; only this .example template lives in the repo)
#   - One skill name per line; lines starting with # are comments
#   - Skills listed here are skipped by upload.sh (and removed if present)
#
# 示例 / Example:
# add-tool-doc
